            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Georgette"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A little sweet as written! I skipped the simple syrup on the second one and it was much better. Also, I used diet lemon-lime soda. Otherwise, very flavorful and an attractive drink too. I also added a few pomegranate seeds to the glass."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jennifer Gasquatch LaFabregu"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'd make it again! Had to make a small change since I ran out of peach schnapps. I did half peach schnapps, half prickly pear liqueur. The 2nd one, I skipped the soda- too sweet. Used sweet &amp; sour instead of lemon juice &amp; simple syrup. Perfect.",
            "datePublished": "2025-06-15T01:24:16.850Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Gretch"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy and tasty! Really liked the color too. I might reduce either the amount of soda or simple syrup, it is on the sweet side. But I will definitely be making this again and again!",
